# Nougat MMD stub — Shuryak & Brenner 2012

**Paper:** Shuryak I. & Brenner D.J. (2012). *Mechanistic Analysis of the Contributions of
DNA and Protein Damage to Radiation-Induced Cell Death.* Radiat. Res. 178(1):17-24.
DOI 10.1667/RR2877.1 · PMID 22687051 · PMC3580191.

## Extraction status
No Nougat / marker parse was performed for this slot.

**Reason:** the primary source available for this paper is the PMC JATS XML
(`../artifacts/paper_oai.xml`, 80 KB, fetched via PMC OAI-PMH `GetRecord`), which is a
first-class semantic representation — it contains the full body, all 5 equations, all figure
captions, both tables, all 24 references. This is *strictly better* input for model
reconstruction than an OCR/layout-parse of the PDF would be. All model equations used in
`../scripts/smoke_shuryak_2012.py` were transcribed directly from the JATS XML.

